    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}'s central eye emits an imperceptible, magical wave of negative energy in a 150-foot Cone. Creatures in that area can't regain Hit Points until the start of the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}'s next turn. An intact Humanoid corpse there instantly rises as a Zombie under the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}'s control and takes its turn immediately after the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} on the same initiative count.</p>",
